Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:56.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泰瑞莎邦德 1943-69 詹姆斯邦德爱妻）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:59.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们还有很多时间）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 真高兴你还没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, Mr. Bond, I'm so glad I caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你办公室来电 说派了直升机来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your office called. They're sending a helicopter to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像事态紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常都是急事 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It usually is. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't concern yourself with the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我比较没用的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my less useful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在搭乘遥控航空班机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now flying Remote Control Airways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得考虑清楚 007 这里离地面还有段距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think twice, 007. It's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等这一刻等了好久 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've looked forward to this moment, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽情地享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to enjoy it to the full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都不尊重死者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, have you no respect for the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会享受 这段惊吓的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you had a pleasant…fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大限将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are fading from my picture, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而尽头就在不远处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the end cannot be far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:34.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电路）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond! Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以谈条件！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么我都愿意给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy you a delicatessen in stainless steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep your hair on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想下去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you want to get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:07:02.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之最高机密》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:33.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣乔治号 法勒他）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安 上面情形如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon. How's it looking topside?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气很好 刚刚才收网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful day. Just bringing the nets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐还是吃鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish for supper again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从苏联卫星资料译码得来的 是英美船舰位置资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decode of Russian satellite data, sir, on British and American ship positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加以核对并告诉上将 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Verify and advise Admiralty. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 午安 长官 - 你好 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Afternoon, sir. - Oh, hello, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我值班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从哪冒出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？- 不明物体迅速接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the deviI's going on here? - An unidentified object closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,保卫控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure Operation Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁ATAC系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destruct ATAC system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:43.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国防部）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 海军大臣跟中将来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes? - First Sea Lord and Vice Admiral, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有坏消息 部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking news, minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们恐怕失去了电子监控船 圣乔治号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we've lost our electronic surveillance ship, the St. Georges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天下午四点 我们收到例行讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a routine message at 1600 hours yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就音讯全无\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今早我们看见漂浮的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sighted floating debris this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 杰克 那里的水有多深？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, Jack. How deep is the water there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕不够深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not deep enough, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 书记同志 在阿尔巴尼亚外海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Comrade Secretary. Off Albania.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们持续监视的 可疑英国间谍船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The suspected British spy ship which we have been monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能借此机会获得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It suggests that there is a chance of obtaining…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,ATAC传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the ATAC transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 同志 我们不会直接介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course, comrade. There will be no direct involvement…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若流出市面 我们就不该错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but if it comes on the market, we should not lose…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难能可贵的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…such a remarkable opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我已经联络了 我们在希腊的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that in mind, I've already contacted our usual friend in Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down you go. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们一个吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a kiss. Give us a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一颗坚果 拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a nut. Here you are. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的袋子 小姐 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your packages, se?orita. - Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.46,0:15:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 亲爱的 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, darling. - Hello, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 亲爱的梅丽娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Melina, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来真美 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look beautiful. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从雅典打来的电话真是个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call from Athens was such a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到你们算幸运 你们突然离开克里特岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lucky to find you. You left Crete so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我想回来开始研究古庙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes, I wanted to come back here and start work on the temple again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在休息吗？- 只是几天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You between jobs? - Only for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 若你有需要我可以帮忙 - 好漂亮 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll lend a hand if you want. - Darling, it's beautiful. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的 开心果给麦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for you and pistachios for Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼妮小姐 你真是赏心悦目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, a feast for my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你身体其他部分呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was going to get around to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好进去 M在放假\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better go in. M's on leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长和参谋总长都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the minister's arrived here with the chief of staff…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要立刻见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and wants to see you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我马上回来 - 我等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be right back. - I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是忘了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, haven't you forgotten something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然M不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, as M's away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, there you are, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长 参谋总长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minister, chief of staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对ATAC系统是否了解？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you aware of our ATAC system, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:18:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动瞄准攻击通讯器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ATAC, sir? Automatic Targeting Attack Communicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用超低频符码传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uses an ultra-low frequency coded transmitter…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以下令我方潜水艇 发射弹道飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to order our submarines to launch ballistic missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,五天前 我方的间谍船 圣乔治号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five days ago, our spy ship, St. Georges was sunk…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在爱奥尼亚海沉没\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the lonian Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上装置了ATAC\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was equipped with ATAC.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,若传送器落入歹人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that transmitter were to fall into the wrong hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会让整个北极星飞弹航队作废\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it would render our entire Polaris fleet useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有指令都会被取消 - 更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every order could be countermanded. - Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方的潜水艇可能受命 攻击本国的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our own submarines could be ordered to attack our own cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打捞过了吗 部长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we begun a salvage operation, minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方打捞行动绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}An official operation was out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣乔治号在阿尔巴尼亚外海\N{\fnArial\fs30}The St. Georges was off the Albanian coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们请海洋考古学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We asked Sir Timothy Havelock…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,提摩西海夫洛 秘密搜寻船只残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the marine archaeologist, to secretly locate the wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他回报结果之前 他和妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he could send in his report, he and his wife were killed…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就被古巴杀手 海克特冈泽拉刺杀身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by a Cuban hit man, Hector Gonzales.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希腊警方借由两人女儿 梅丽娜的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Greek police were able to identify Gonzales…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出冈泽拉的身分背景\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from a description given to them by Melina, Sir Havelock's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是回流行动 资料全在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Undertow. The information's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在冈泽拉在马德里附近的别墅内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Gonzales is at a villa near Madrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔离他 并施与必要压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolate him and apply the necessary pressure…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出是谁雇用他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to find out who hired him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最高机密）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:16.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣马汀）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,渥尔特PPK手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Walther PPk…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国情报员的标准配备\N{\fnArial\fs30}…standard issue, British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}License to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你是谁 你已留得太久了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are, you've outstayed your welcome. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:23.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内装防盗器）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望你有开车来 - 这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I hope you have a car. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.91,0:24:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 他杀了我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - He killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海夫洛夫妇吗？我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Havelocks? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道冈泽拉在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know where Gonzales was?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过侦探社 你来那里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through a detective agency. What were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.73,0:24:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部车的马力似乎比不上对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we're being out-horsepowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.93,0:25:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走下面那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the low road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用那么低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that low.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我来开车吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mind if I drive, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.53,0:26:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,先倒车 再往前 快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go backwards. Forwards. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱在乡间开车 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a drive in the country, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.37,0:27:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.36,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我们还没正式打过招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, we haven't been properly introduced, Melina.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.43,0:28:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bond, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.04,0:28:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥林匹克航空十一点有班机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olympic has a flight at 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去机场应该很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be safe to go to the airport now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.62,0:28:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 我很好 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回父亲的船上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going back to your father's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我要延续他的工作 但这件事还没了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm continuing his work, but this business is still unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 找出雇用冈泽拉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What business? - The man who paid Gonzales.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.94,0:29:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国人有句话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese have a saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.61,0:29:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,“复仇者必自绝”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Before setting out on revenge, you first dig two graves."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.65,0:29:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不期望你能了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是英国人 但我是半个希腊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're English, but I'm half Greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.95,0:29:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,希腊女人都像 复仇女神伊蕾克拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Greek women, like Electra…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.72,0:29:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不忘替深爱的人报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…always avenge their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.59,0:29:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.14,0:29:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该去质问冈泽拉 而非让海夫洛小姐动私刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were meant to question Gonzales, not let Miss Havelock perforate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.81,0:29:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quite agree, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须告知首相 回流行动已经胎死腹中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tell the prime minister Operation Undertow is dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.51,0:29:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会把我们痛骂一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll have our guts for garters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.45,0:29:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你再仔细看一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care to look again…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.22,0:29:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告的第二页第四段里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at page two, paragraph four of my report, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:29:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有提到我看见某人付钱给冈泽拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will note that I saw someone paying off Gonzales.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.46,0:30:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设那是刺杀海夫洛的费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, assuming that that was for Havelock's murder…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么仍有一丝希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then there's still a glimmer of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.03,0:30:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们能认出那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could identify that someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.53,0:30:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不试着用辨识系统？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try the identigraph?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.04,0:30:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 事不宜迟 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Get cracking, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.87,0:30:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.81,0:30:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 Q 史密斯 手臂还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Q. Smithers, how's the arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.05,0:30:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,复原得很好 谢谢长官关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming along very nicely, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.52,0:30:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that'll come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这做什么 007？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.36,0:30:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 使用辨识系统 Q - 这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Identigraph, Q. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.67,0:30:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “万针嬉春”？- 不好笑 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stinging in the rain? - That's not funny, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那部莲花成功组合好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you managed to get the Lotus back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.21,0:30:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要调侃这些装备 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disregard these jibes about our equipment, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.38,0:30:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你用它们出任务时 会觉得好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you find it funny in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.65,0:31:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这立体影像辨识系统 还在实验阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}This 3D Visual Identigraph is still in the experimental stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.76,0:31:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有目标的特征素描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, once we get a composite of the man…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.03,0:31:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能从国际刑警 中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we can find a match by patching into the photographic files…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或法国警察处的 照片资料库中找出对比\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the Surete, Interpol, CIA, the Mossad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.41,0:31:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有西德警方 你已经告诉我五次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the West German police. You've told me so already five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.31,0:31:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在描述你要辨识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now describe the person you wish to identify…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.32,0:31:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就输入资讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'll program the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.36,0:31:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,白种男性 三十多岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male Caucasian, late thirties.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发柔软 淡棕色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hair: fine, light brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.17,0:31:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头发中分 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Parted in the middle. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.01,0:31:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.58,0:31:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.81,0:32:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色 再灰一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue. A little grayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 现在轮到鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. You have it. Now, nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是鼻子 不是香蕉 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A nose, not a banana, Q. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.03,0:32:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴唇再厚一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lips fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.43,0:32:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 嘴巴再宽一点 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, mouth wider. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.04,0:32:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.54,0:32:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 莎朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sharon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.11,0:32:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能走了 我来锁门 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can go. I'll lock up. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常接近了 Q 现在只差眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon we're almost there, Q, apart from glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不锈钢镜框\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel-rimmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.29,0:32:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 八角形\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Octagonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,八角形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octagonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.49,0:32:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他 他就是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. That's our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.70,0:32:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我会找出吻合的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'll try and get a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.95,0:33:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.31,0:33:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的人是艾米罗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man we want is Emile Leopold Locque…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁塞尔地下组织的推手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an enforcer in the Brussels underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被指控数项罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been convicted of several…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.39,0:33:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是特别残酷的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…particularly brutal murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.56,0:33:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他勒死心理医生后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He escaped from Namur Prison…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.83,0:33:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从纳摩监狱脱逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by strangling his psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.06,0:33:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在马赛和香港替贩毒组织工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has worked for drug syndicates in Marseilles and Hong k ong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在据说与希腊走私贩狼疺为奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now reported working for Greek smugglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.53,0:33:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利情报局 认为他目前在哥迪纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ltalian Secret Service think that he is, at this moment, in Cortina.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.54,0:33:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫驻派北义的法洛拉和你联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll instruct Ferrara, our man in northern ltaly, to contact you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.11,0:33:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 长官 - 007 不要再搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - And 007, try not to muck it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.11,0:33:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你锁门好了 让我出去好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you to lock up. Let me out, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:35:00.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（托芬拿山 早上十点）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:08.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（托芬拿山）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.02,0:35:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年在印支堡的雪比较厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The snow this year is better at lnnsbruck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.99,0:35:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圣米兹的就差多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not at St. Moritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.62,0:35:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法拉洛 - 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ferrara. - Bond. James.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.63,0:35:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.63,0:35:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦应该已经告知你情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume London has briefed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.33,0:35:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,若罗克在哥迪纳 我们就能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Locque's in Cortina, we'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.70,0:35:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个可靠的希腊联络人 他是亲英派的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a reliable Greek contact here, an Anglophile.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.64,0:35:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去年协助我们破获走私集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped us out last year on a smuggling operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.77,0:35:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哥迪纳干什么？- 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he doing in Cortina? - He…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.75,0:36:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年在这里的小木屋度假几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spends a few months a year here at his chalet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.49,0:36:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对航运 保险 石油探勘都很熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in shipping, insurance, oil exploration.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.82,0:36:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事都一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}knows everything going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.86,0:36:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可靠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.96,0:36:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国颁给他皇家勋章 奖励他在大战时英勇抗敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British gave him the king's Medal for resistance fighting during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.66,0:36:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我能见他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but can I meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.57,0:36:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我安排好了 他在奥林匹克冰宫等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've set it up. He is waiting for us at the Olympic ice rink.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.72,0:36:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Se?or kristatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.96,0:36:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯斯达图 艾利凯斯达图 - 邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- kristatos. Ari kristatos. - Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.13,0:36:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起坐下喝一杯好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care to join me in some gluhwein?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very good idea. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.47,0:36:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 有何能效劳之处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, gentlemen, how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.55,0:37:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞助的选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My protege. A sure winner…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.62,0:37:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,下届奥运铁定得金牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the next Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.15,0:37:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常投入在溜冰的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's completely absorbed in her skating…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.65,0:37:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对真实世界一知半解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but innocent in the ways of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她赢得金牌的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day she wins the gold medal…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.39,0:37:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会是我此生最快乐的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be the greatest in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.83,0:37:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 这些是你的新仰慕者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bibi, here are some new admirers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.31,0:37:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 法拉洛先生 这是碧碧达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, Mr. Ferrara, Bibi Dahl…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.48,0:37:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是教练乔可芭布林 她曾是世界级选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and her coach, Jacoba Brink, once a world-class skater herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.31,0:37:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过布林小姐溜冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen Miss Brink skate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人很快也会看见你的精采演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the world will soon be seeing a great deal of your skating too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.98,0:37:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她更努力一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if she works harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比现在加倍努力 - 艾利叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Much harder. - Oh, Uncle Ari.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.85,0:37:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能休息一下吗？累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I stop now? I'm pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得由布林小姐决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for Miss Brink to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.66,0:37:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 再练半小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Bibi, another half hour of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.53,0:37:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾利叔叔 带我去看滑雪射击好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Ari, will you take me to the biathlon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 你知道下午我得工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bibi, you know I have to work this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.94,0:38:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 碧碧想知道 你是否愿意陪她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bibi wants to know if you would escort her, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.97,0:38:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样不太 - 若有人能陪她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think… - I would feel better…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.98,0:38:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会放心很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if there were someone with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.58,0:38:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之至 我住在镜子山饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be delighted. I'm staying at the Miramonti.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.88,0:38:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮两位什么忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.62,0:38:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识这个人吗？- 认识 他是罗克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know this man? - Yes. Locque.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.03,0:38:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦布的左右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Columbo's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,米洛哥伦布 他牵涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milos Columbo. His name came up in connection…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年一项走私活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a smuggling operation last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.40,0:38:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他最轻的罪状 还有毒品 贩卖人口和谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the least of his offenses. Drugs, white slavery, contract murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.57,0:38:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在希腊黑道 人称他“白鸽”\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Greek underworld, he in known as "the Dove."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.21,0:38:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.88,0:38:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这白鸽在哪里？- 应该在希腊某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is this Dove? - Somewhere in Greece, I would guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.25,0:38:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经情同手足 但现在他恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we were like brothers. Now he hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.08,0:38:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们加入希腊反抗军 并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought together in the Greek resistance…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后共同对抗共产党\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then against the Communists.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.05,0:38:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他就走上不同的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, he took a different path.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.43,0:38:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你拨冗 凯斯达图先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time, Mr. kristatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:38:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣幸 我很快就要去科福岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure. I leave for Corfu soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.66,0:39:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何消息 我就会通知法拉洛先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I get any more information, I will call Ferrara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.21,0:39:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易奇 你认为怎样？这位“白鸽”哥伦布\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Luigi? Does this "Dove" Columbo…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.32,0:39:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有本事进行打捞作业吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have the resources to mount a salvage operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.32,0:39:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他在爱琴海经营 跨洋货运船队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, definitely. He runs a fleet of intercoastal freighters in the Aegean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.09,0:39:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打个电话给米兰办公室 也许会有更多关于他的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ring my office in Milano. They may have more on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.04,0:39:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待会见 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luigi, I'll see you later. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.72,0:39:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这一支吗 小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the one you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.82,0:40:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我买了 替我送到克里斯塔罗饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I'll take it. Deliver it to the Hotel Cristalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.26,0:40:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.47,0:40:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要买什么？- 给我一打百合花\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I help you? - Yes, give me a dozen lilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.81,0:40:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.05,0:40:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会再来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pick them up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.13,0:40:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请送到他的葬礼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them to the funeral, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.92,0:41:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要告诉我 为何来到哥迪纳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down. Would you mind telling me what the devil you're doing in Cortina?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.29,0:41:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你的电报 - 什么电报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your telegram. - What telegram?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说你找到那个人 要在今天跟我在这里碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said you found the man and to meet you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.40,0:41:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没送电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't send a telegram.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.33,0:41:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.67,0:41:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The station, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.37,0:41:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要走了吗？- 不是“我们” 是你要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we leaving? - Not "we." You. And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想命令我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.76,0:41:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到雇用冈泽拉的人了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the man who hired Gonzales?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.93,0:41:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.57,0:41:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.97,0:41:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你来的原因 司机 马上回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here. Driver, stop! Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.67,0:41:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要留下 - 以便亲手宰了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm staying. - So you can put an arrow in his back?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.18,0:42:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这样做 就休想找到幕后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that and we'll never find out who or what is behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.38,0:42:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的是我父母 不是你的 让我下车 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my parents they killed, not yours. Let me out. Driver, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.12,0:42:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melina, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.06,0:42:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次算你运气好 但他们已经盯上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were lucky once, but they are onto you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.79,0:42:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,电报和刚才那些摩托车 都能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The telegram, the motorcycles back there. They prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.26,0:42:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我处理 - 你？为何牵扯到你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me handle this. - You? How are you involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.87,0:42:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说此事严重关系到 你我两国的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can tell you is it's something of vital interest to both our countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.74,0:42:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我父母的死更重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}More important than my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.58,0:42:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲也有参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为此事 值得让他付出生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought it important enough to risk his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.51,0:42:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅丽娜 请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Melina, please trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.35,0:42:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,回翠亚娜号上等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the Triaina and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力调查 然后就直接回到科福岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me find out what I can here, then I'll come straight to Corfu.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.35,0:42:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I promise you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回去等 但别让我等太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go back and wait, but not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.26,0:42:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.64,0:43:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在冰宫没有淋浴设备吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they have showers at the ice rink?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.25,0:43:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个门房是我的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the porters is a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.08,0:43:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他愿意为我做任何事 我也愿意为你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll do anything for me, and I'll do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.29,0:43:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受宠若惊 碧碧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm exceedingly flattered, Bibi…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.59,0:43:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你正在受训\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but you're in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.43,0:44:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑 大家都知道嘿咻 可以增强肌肉性能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a laugh. Everybody knows it builds up muscle tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.43,0:44:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那借由穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about building up a little more muscle tone…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来增强如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by putting on your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.71,0:44:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.21,0:44:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个很棒的女孩 碧碧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're wonderful, Bibi…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.81,0:44:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的艾利叔叔 应该不会赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I don't think your Uncle Ari would approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.32,0:44:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他？他以为我还是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? He thinks I'm still a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.89,0:44:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快把衣服穿上 我去买冰淇淋给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, you get your clothes on, and I'll buy you an ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.53,0:44:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.07,0:44:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来不用换气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever come up for air?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我会得到金牌的原因 我很会控制呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'll get the gold medal: breath control.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.08,0:44:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你输不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, you can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.48,0:45:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在上场的是艾瑞克格\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, Erich Kriegler…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.61,0:45:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年东欧滑雪射击冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}…last year's East European champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.09,0:45:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是艾瑞克格\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Erich kriegler.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.79,0:45:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,东欧冠军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The East German champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.20,0:45:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很帅对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 你知道吗？你真是善变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something, Bibi? You're fickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.30,0:45:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Erich!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.17,0:45:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们去看他射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go watch him shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.70,0:46:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在终点喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a drink at the finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.91,0:46:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 我得先行离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bibi, I'm afraid I have to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.98,0:46:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 留下来陪我 - 我和人有约\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, James, stay with me. - I have an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.32,0:46:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等一下会去练习场 和我道别吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come and say goodbye to me at the practice rink later?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.62,0:46:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 詹姆斯 我们很快就要回希腊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, James, we're going back to Greece soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.92,0:46:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但若我来不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but if I can't make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.92,0:46:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说 别再长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all I can say is don't grow up any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.39,0:46:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让异性受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The opposite sex won't survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.41,0:55:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.15,0:55:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别乱按那些按钮 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't play with any of the switches. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.29,0:56:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.13,0:56:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么久才来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, what took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.77,0:56:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走风景比较美的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the scenic route.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.80,0:56:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈你的男朋友艾瑞克格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more about your boyfriend, Erich kriegler.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.11,0:56:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不抽烟 只吃健康食品 甚至不和女生讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't smoke, he only eats health foods and he won't even talk to girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.98,0:56:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你在忌妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, you're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.71,0:56:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你还能多谈谈 我这位情敌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. What else can you tell me about my rival for your affections?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.95,0:56:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他叛逃东德\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he's a defector from East Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.72,0:56:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧 该去按摩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bibi, it is time for your rubdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.87,0:56:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想把你生吞活剥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could eat you up alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.67,0:56:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 邦德 我们还会再见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, Mr. Bond, but not goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.44,0:58:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我六点就会办完事 在这里等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be finished around 6:00. Meet me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.02,0:58:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.09,0:58:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打电话到翠亚娜号 他们说你到岸上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I radio telephoned the Triaina, and they told me you were coming ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.46,0:58:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得替船员采购用品 一起来吧 顺便聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go shopping for the crew. Come with me, we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.39,0:58:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.79,0:59:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you may need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.99,0:59:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲生前最爱在这看风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father loved the view from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.79,1:00:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想像得到 - 我们常来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can see why. - We came here often.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.19,1:00:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 科福岛是你家吗？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is Corfu your home? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.53,1:00:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真正的家是翠亚娜号 希腊诸岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real home's always been the Triaina, the Greek islands…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.10,1:00:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,土耳其 北非 随着父亲的工作浪迹天涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Turkey, North Africa, wherever my father's work took us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.50,1:00:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有留下任何资料吗？也许对我们有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he leave any notes? They could help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.31,1:00:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.28,1:00:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell the truth…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.68,1:00:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死后我一直没勇气 进入他的书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I haven't had the courage to go into his study since.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.59,1:00:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量别去想这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to think about it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.32,1:00:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要去赌场见个人 他也许能提供线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm meeting a man tonight at the casino who may give us a lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.66,1:01:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在流汗 邦奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're perspiring, Bunky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.33,1:01:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,女伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, contessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.84,1:01:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十万\N{\fnArial\fs30}500, 000.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.41,1:01:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,才一半？你的勇气上哪去了 邦奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only half? Where's your courage, Bunky?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.75,1:01:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气敌不过很背的手气 女伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage is no match for an unfriendly shoe, countess.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.95,1:01:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才对 邦奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Bunky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.76,1:01:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚运气很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.48,1:02:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持现状赢面较大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odds favor standing pat.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.55,1:02:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,照机率而言是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you play the odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.16,1:02:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我换成现金好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you cash these in for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.30,1:02:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.75,1:02:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要餐前酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aperitif, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.39,1:02:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一杯乌索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouzo for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.62,1:02:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一杯威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.99,1:02:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,虾球 沙拉和法式牛肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the prawns, salad and Bourdetto.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.60,1:02:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的选择 我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}An excellent choice. I'll have the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.77,1:03:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我推荐家乡的白酒 让你品尝好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I suggest a white wine from my home place?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.57,1:03:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 白酒味道太浓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll forgive me, that's a little too scented for my palate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.61,1:03:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢菲泰基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the Theotaki Aspro.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.15,1:03:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次会面后 我一直问我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}After our last meeting, I am asking myself…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.05,1:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要知道 哥伦布左右手罗克的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why you want to know about Locque, Columbo's man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.16,1:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道哥伦布将海洛因在此加工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Columbo runs heroin to be refined here…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.83,1:03:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再走私到英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before it's sent to England.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.76,1:03:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道原因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think I see the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.03,1:03:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是英国缉毒单位派来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from the British Narcotics Board.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.77,1:03:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说得对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.30,1:03:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.34,1:03:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you luck, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.21,1:03:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得警告你 要阻止哥伦布并下容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must warn you, stopping Columbo will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.31,1:03:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后台很硬 没办法说逮捕就逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has important connections. You cannot just arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.92,1:03:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得想别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find a different way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.22,1:03:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.59,1:03:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气馁了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this discourage you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.53,1:04:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我他的下落 - 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me where he is. - Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和穿蓝衣的女士在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the woman in blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.54,1:04:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩形同陌路 但我要你见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ignore each other, but I wanted you to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.04,1:04:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这座赌场的秘密合伙人 但我们非常安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a secret partner in this casino. But we are perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.38,1:04:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在自己的地盘不会轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will do nothing in his own place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.35,1:04:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位女伯爵呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the countess?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.72,1:04:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是丽索 奥地利人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisl, an Austrian.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.75,1:04:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,昂贵的情妇 有时为赌场作诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expensive mistress. She sometimes shills for the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.72,1:04:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那是别人的钱的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she bets it's with other people's money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.18,1:04:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得警告你 要阻止哥伦布并下容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must warn you, stopping Columbo will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.22,1:04:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后台很硬 没办法说逮捕就逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has important connections. You cannot just arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.89,1:04:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得想别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find a different way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.46,1:05:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.46,1:05:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气馁了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this discourage you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.13,1:05:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.25,1:05:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是恶心 竟敢这样和我说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a disgusting man. How dare you talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.75,1:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想怎么说都行 给我坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will speak to you any way I please. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.02,1:05:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要出洋相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a spectacle of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.62,1:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.69,1:05:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing would please me more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.34,1:05:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这也许是好机会 - 也许是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This may be an opportunity. - This may be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.01,1:05:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,照机率而言是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you play the odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.88,1:05:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 用我的车吧 我去玩几局\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish. Take my car. I'll play a little chemin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.71,1:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫司机回来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask the chauffeur to come back for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.29,1:06:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.36,1:06:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有荣幸送你回家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I drive you home?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.33,1:06:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢 我坐计程车就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. I'll take a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.93,1:06:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No courage?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.93,1:06:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 这可是千载难逢的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you may have a job finding one at this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.11,1:06:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像个绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look like a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.21,1:06:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.25,1:06:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是女伯爵丽索冯斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Countess Lisl Von Schlaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.05,1:06:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.66,1:06:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在写关于希腊毒贩的小说 你认识一些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm writing a novel about Greek smugglers. know any?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.39,1:06:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒贩？我怎么可能认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smugglers? How would I know any smugglers?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.83,1:06:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你这种身分地位的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would think that a lady in your position…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.67,1:06:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该人脉相当广\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would get to know many things.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.80,1:06:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会相当感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.41,1:06:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多感激？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How grateful?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.24,1:06:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.51,1:07:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欣赏知恩图报的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I adore grateful men.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.11,1:07:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天打给你好吗 女伯爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I call you tomorrow, countess?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.94,1:07:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夜猫子 冰箱里有香槟和生蚝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a night person. I have champagne and oysters in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.35,1:07:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进来吃点宵夜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not come in for a bite?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.12,1:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你的服务到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't need you anymore tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.78,1:08:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cheers. - Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.66,1:08:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.59,1:08:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的睡衣好滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me nightie's slipping.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.20,1:08:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口音也是 女伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is your accent, countess.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼彻斯特？- 很接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manchester? - Close.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.74,1:08:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,利物浦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liverpool.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.30,1:08:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这件衣服的主人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an amusing performance…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.07,1:08:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,互动很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…between you and the owner of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.51,1:08:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦布到底对你说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly did Columbo whisper to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.25,1:08:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你是间谍 要我去打探你的底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're a spy. To find out more about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.85,1:08:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你探到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.25,1:08:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.48,1:09:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开时可以开我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready to leave, you can take my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.92,1:09:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像在下逐客令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a dismissal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.92,1:09:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能和你共享早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking forward to breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.86,1:10:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽索 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisl! Lisl, come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.93,1:10:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.05,1:11:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 女伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, countess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.49,1:11:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么处置你？- 没办法说逮捕就逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What should I do with you? - You cannot just arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得想别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find a different way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.04,1:12:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气馁了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this discourage you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.68,1:12:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.25,1:12:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这里 英国情报员邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Mr. Bond of the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.35,1:12:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.29,1:12:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的人是凯斯达图 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it is kristatos you want, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.29,1:12:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他讲的是他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you about himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.96,1:12:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,后台硬的人其实是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one with the powerful connections.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.56,1:12:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗克替他工作 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locque works for him, not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是走私没错 我走私黄金 钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smuggle, yes. I smuggle gold, diamonds…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,香烟 开心果\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cigarettes, pistachio nuts…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.14,1:12:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对没有海洛因\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but no heroin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.51,1:12:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 贩毒的事我留给他去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. That I leave to him…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.98,1:12:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他没有忙着替苏联\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he is not too busy working for Russia…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.41,1:12:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗你或我国家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…against my country and yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.22,1:12:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的国家颁给他皇家勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}My country awarded him the king's Medal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.15,1:12:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但其他人为这勋章送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. But other people died for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.99,1:12:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在希腊战争中 他是个双面谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the fighting in Crete, he was a double agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.56,1:12:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇家勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}king's Medal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.43,1:12:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是替可怜的丽索难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would laugh if my heart was not so heavy…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会笑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about my poor Lisl.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.74,1:13:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯图达设计你 有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does kristatos gain by setting you up?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.87,1:13:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道太多他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know too much about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.41,1:13:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不希望我成为绊脚石\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.05,1:13:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用英国情报员借刀杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}By using a British agent to do his dirty work for him…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.75,1:13:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的政府搞不好还会 再给他一个勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your government might give him another medal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.82,1:13:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为何该相信你？- 今晚我就能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why should I believe you? - I'll prove it to you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.89,1:13:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go together to his warehouse…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.70,1:13:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在阿尔巴尼亚的仓库如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in Albania, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.83,1:13:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我明早前不回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't report in by morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.33,1:13:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国和全希腊警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not only my people, but the entire Greek police will be down on you…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.47,1:13:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会对你穷追猛打\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like a load of bricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.94,1:13:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.84,1:13:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了明天 我们就会变成好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}By tomorrow, we'll be good friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.21,1:13:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为友谊喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.75,1:13:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天再喝好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.80,1:14:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.33,1:14:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看人很准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good judge of men.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.47,1:14:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你有希腊人所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, you have what the Greeks call tha'ros.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.54,1:14:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guts.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.01,1:14:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 哥伦布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have you, Mr. Columbo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.92,1:14:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.13,1:16:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,山多斯的药局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santos' drug store.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.64,1:16:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.96,1:16:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆潜水装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.I.M. diving equipment…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.73,1:16:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于超过海深三百尺的 打捞工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for salvage work at depths of over 300 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.31,1:17:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,生鸦片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raw opium.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.55,1:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,老毒贩的把戏 凯斯达图全都很在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old smuggler's trick. kristatos knows them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.26,1:17:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你的手下离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your men out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.23,1:17:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.09,1:20:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这是你留给法洛拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left this with Ferrara, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.64,1:20:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对高度没有概念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had no head for heights.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.60,1:21:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣乔治号在哪里沉没的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the St. Georges sink?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.97,1:21:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不确定 只知道在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be sure for certain. We know it was in this vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.01,1:22:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲利用古庙当作掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was using the temple as a front.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.85,1:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图将你父亲灭口\N{\fnArial\fs30}kristatos killed your father…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.15,1:22:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就无法抢先一步找到圣乔治号\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so he wouldn't find the St. Georges before he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.08,1:22:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图 我能帮上什么忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}kristatos. How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.86,1:22:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲把航海日志放在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does your father keep his daily log?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.26,1:22:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daily log.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.16,1:22:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲和他是三十年的老朋友 他每句话都会重覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father and he were pals for 30 years. He repeats everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.94,1:22:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我们一个吻 - 他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give us a kiss. - What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.94,1:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.34,1:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.61,1:22:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.85,1:22:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是速记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all shorthand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.88,1:22:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用独特速记法 只有我会解读\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used a special kind. Only I could decipher it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.99,1:22:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他乘坐海王星号数度去勘查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made several surveys in Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.06,1:22:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么海王星？- 一艘双人潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's Neptune? - Our two-man submarine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.27,1:23:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写说看见了潜水钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw a diving bell here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.80,1:23:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水钟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diving bell?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.71,1:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,勘采石油用的 是凯斯达图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oil exploration. kristatos.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.31,1:23:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后 他在同样地方看到残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days later, he sighted a wreck in the same area.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.08,1:23:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.08,1:23:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他最后一笔速记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his last entry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.89,1:23:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天他就遭杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.92,1:23:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那种深度空气没用 我们需要氧氦混合气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air would be useless at this depth. We need a mixture of oxygen and helium.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.33,1:23:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有所有必需的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the necessary equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.97,1:23:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事越少人知道越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less people that know, the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.87,1:23:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫船员休假去 除了大副和两名员工以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give the crew shore leave except for the mate and two others.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.41,1:23:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们着手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.95,1:24:43.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣乔治号 法勒他）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.21,1:25:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,584尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}584 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.48,1:25:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧氦混合气能撑八分钟 我们动作要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}An oxygen-helium mix will give us eight minutes. We'll have to work fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.28,1:25:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员不会把传送器毁了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't the crew have destroyed the transmitter?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们有机会设定引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if they'd had the chance to set the explosive timer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.49,1:25:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a visitor below.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.53,1:26:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,节省气体 必要时才说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conserve your gas supply. Speak only when necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.42,1:26:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他是独自觅食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope he was dining alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.51,1:27:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好回到潜水艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.28,1:27:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.66,1:27:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是控制舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be the command cabin.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.58,1:28:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.33,1:28:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要自动摧毁装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Main destruct timer…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.06,1:28:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在ATAC杠杆右边 双重装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}…under lever right of ATAC housing, dualled…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.43,1:28:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过反操纵充电器 使主电路失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by ring main circuit through anti-handling charger."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.24,1:28:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动摧毁装置设定在一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The destruct timer's set at one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.77,1:28:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为何杠杆没有拉下\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason, the lever wasn't pulled.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.68,1:28:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,热力充电的传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmitter with a thermite charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.74,1:28:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold these.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.41,1:28:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要绕过电震板\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To bypass trembler switch…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.31,1:29:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下列次序剪电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cut wires in following procedure."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.25,1:29:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.47,1:29:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,螺丝起子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.75,1:29:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.25,1:30:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, help!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.85,1:30:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 我撑不下去 - 我们都能撑过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James, I won't make it. - We both will.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.79,1:31:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回潜水艇 我来拖延他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the sub. I'll stall him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.99,1:33:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.93,1:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试关掉二氧化碳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and close the CO2.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.60,1:34:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.62,1:35:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 詹姆斯 它可有五千年历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, James. It's 5000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.20,1:36:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.97,1:36:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替我们省了拆除的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have saved us the trouble of disarming it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.40,1:36:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿帕 拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apostis, take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.01,1:36:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我船上的船员呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my men?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.31,1:36:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就会去见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be joining them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.65,1:36:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the girl go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.62,1:36:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会付你双倍酬劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll double whatever you're getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.59,1:36:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不毁约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never go back on a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.09,1:37:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免声誉受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be bad for my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.11,1:37:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会负责送达 并把钱带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will deliver it and return with the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.88,1:37:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像苏联国安局情报员的风格 依照协议 地点由我决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voice of the k GB. Our agreement was that I designate the meeting place.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.02,1:37:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们付钱后 我就交出传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they pay, I will give them the transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.82,1:37:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让它离开你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must not be let out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.19,1:37:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我的视线 我们要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor mine. Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.89,1:37:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把ATAC带到圣西洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take the ATAC to St. CyriI's.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.00,1:37:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣西洛？我来安排收货事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. CyriI's. I'll arrange the pickup.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.94,1:37:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口绑紧一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bind that wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.31,1:37:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不想让血流到水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want blood in the water. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.61,1:37:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.55,1:38:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经技穷了 海夫洛小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have shot your last bolt, Miss Havelock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.52,1:38:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚不用绑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave their legs free.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.76,1:38:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,双腿是美味的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll make appetizing bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.87,1:38:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到会是这种结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think it would end like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.87,1:38:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.46,1:38:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.33,1:39:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around. We go again.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.00,1:39:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.69,1:40:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.08,1:41:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.58,1:41:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.52,1:41:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头 压过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn. Run them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.57,1:41:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.35,1:42:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼把他们吃了 回码头去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sharks have them. Make port.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.84,1:42:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.48,1:42:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.41,1:43:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我一个吻 - 麦斯 现在别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give us a kiss. - Max, not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.78,1:43:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}kristatos is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.59,1:43:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许正在去莫斯科 或哈瓦纳的途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And probably headed to Moscow or Havana by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.32,1:43:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远逮不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.46,1:43:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是ATAC\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the ATAC.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.16,1:43:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,ATAC到圣西洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}ATAC to St. CyriI's. ATAC to St. CyriI's.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.97,1:43:28.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣西洛）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.34,1:44:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我犯的罪 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Father, for I have sinned.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.24,1:44:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太轻描淡写了 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's putting it mildly, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.88,1:44:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的消息令人吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your signal sent Whitehall into shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.22,1:44:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我们在希腊 已经找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far we have managed to locate…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.75,1:44:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,439个圣西洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…439 St. CyriI's in Greece.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.96,1:44:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道凯斯达图把ATAC 藏在哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven only knows to which one kristatos took the ATAC.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.16,1:44:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个消息灵通的人 能提供线索 Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a well-informed person to contact about that, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.84,1:45:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣西洛 我们以前都在那躲避德军\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. CyriI's, where we used to hide from the Germans.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.65,1:45:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有凯斯达图会把废弃修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only kristatos would make an abandoned monastery…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.28,1:45:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当成避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}…his personal retreat.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.19,1:45:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 为了这特别的场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, I've been studying this place for years…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.39,1:45:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经研究这里好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for just such an occasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.96,1:45:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里分开 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll split here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.79,1:45:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好从右翼接近 距离建筑比较远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best approach is on the right face, away from the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.00,1:45:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后必须设法到左边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make towards the shed on the left…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.20,1:45:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小屋 那里有电线和电苐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which houses the basket and the electronic winch.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.84,1:45:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能从小屋里操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be operated only from the shed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.17,1:45:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.45,1:45:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该多带点人手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have brought more people.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.22,1:45:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯希望有奇迹发生 - 我们只有五个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James is counting on surprise. - But we are only five men.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.76,1:45:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.28,1:46:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,十八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.85,1:46:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,十九\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nineteen…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.35,1:46:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十\N{\fnArial\fs30}…twenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.85,1:46:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再做50下 - 真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fifty more. - That's the pits!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.89,1:47:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该在奥斯陆的 因斯布鲁克溜冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be skating in Oslo, in lnnsbruck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.42,1:47:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这阴森的地方干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we in this creepy place?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.29,1:47:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划改变 我们要去古巴住几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our plans are changed. We are going to live in Cuba for a few months.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.80,1:47:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 古巴？- 你就能专心溜冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cuba! - You can skate without distractions.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.07,1:47:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会当观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be your audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.57,1:47:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是碍事 我要赢金牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a drag. I want to win the gold medal.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.10,1:47:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都希望你得金牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all want that.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.77,1:47:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.64,1:47:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对我而言太老了 我要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're too old for me. I'm splitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.34,1:47:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怂恿她和我作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done this. Poisoned her against me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.92,1:47:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别恼羞成怒 艾利叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blow your top, Ari.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.62,1:47:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少烦她 - 我会和你算帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave her alone. - I will deal with you, Jacoba Brink…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.02,1:47:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像对付那些背叛我的人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as I deal with everyone who betrays me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.30,1:47:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bibi…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.50,1:47:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're so young.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.90,1:47:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得有赞助人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have a sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.24,1:47:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会另外再找一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.38,1:47:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去查看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go outside and check the guards.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.01,1:48:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机到了马上通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know as soon as the helicopter arrives.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.20,1:53:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图手下的杀手之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of kristatos' killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.66,1:56:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.40,1:56:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.91,1:56:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 乔治 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, George. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.61,1:56:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 除非你要我把你丢下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, unless you want me to go without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.78,1:56:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚我绝不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I will never leave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.92,1:56:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的将军迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your general is late.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.49,1:56:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有恶劣天候才会耽误他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only bad weather would delay him.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.14,1:56:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the windows.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.41,1:56:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.58,1:56:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事的 不用管他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right. Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.32,1:57:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.36,1:57:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.63,1:57:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.07,1:57:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就跟在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.84,1:57:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.09,1:57:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.82,1:57:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯达图呢？回答小声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's kristatos? And keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.69,1:57:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要离开他 走之前绝不能让他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are leaving him. He mustn't know until we are gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.23,1:57:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你帮我们 我们就协助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll help you if you help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.77,1:57:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.08,1:57:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the guards?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.08,1:58:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.92,1:58:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.07,1:58:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.34,1:59:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯斯达图在哪里？- 广场的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's kristatos? - The other side of the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.08,1:59:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.85,1:59:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,布林小姐呢？你把她怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Brink? What have you done to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.62,1:59:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回房去 - 你下地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go back to your room! - You can go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.99,1:59:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.84,2:01:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯斯达图在哪里？- 带着ATAC走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's kristatos? - He's left with the ATAC.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.79,2:01:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.99,2:01:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不像以前一样灵活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not as fast as you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.24,2:01:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 梅丽娜 这不是解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Melina, that's not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.74,2:01:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把他交给希腊警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll turn him over to the Greek police.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.48,2:01:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,少挡路 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.32,2:01:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.38,2:01:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得准备好挖两座坟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but be prepared to dig those two graves.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.36,2:02:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's detente, comrade.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.83,2:02:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得不到 我也得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have it. I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.96,2:03:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧碧似乎找到新赞助人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems as though Bibi has a new sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.91,2:03:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进展如何？- 我已经布好了一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going? - I've patched through…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.74,2:03:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,机密的卫星线\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a high security line to the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.08,2:03:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以尝试联络邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try Bond now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.85,2:03:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 接通十号了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Are you through to Number 10?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.95,2:03:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在待命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.02,2:03:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我想做什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'd like?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.13,2:03:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.86,2:03:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在月光下游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moonlight swim.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.07,2:03:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.98,2:04:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.48,2:04:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,全为了你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your eyes only, darling.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.43,2:04:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在 - 接首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's there. - Patch in the prime minister.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.90,2:04:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接 丹尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it, Denis.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.84,2:04:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.31,2:04:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生在线上 首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond on the line, prime minister.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.44,2:04:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.68,2:04:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想亲自致电给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wanted to call you personally and to say how pleased…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.11,2:04:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴这次任务圆满成功 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we all are that your mission was a success, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.65,2:04:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.15,2:04:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谢我 邦德先生 你的勇气和机智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me, Mr. Bond. Your courage and resourcefulness…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.79,2:04:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国家的光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are a credit to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.36,2:04:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼斯和我都很期待与你会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denis and I look forward to meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.43,2:04:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 若有我能效劳之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, if there is anything I can do for you…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.00,2:05:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们一个吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a kiss, give us a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.70,2:05:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是的 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, really, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.80,2:05:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想线路有点问题 首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're having a little trouble with the line, madam.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.41,2:05:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 再呼叫一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiot. Get on to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.81,2:05:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,007\N{\fnArial\fs30}007. 007.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.28,2:05:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德？！你疯了吗？什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond?! Have you gone mad? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.18,2:05:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond?! Bond?! Bond?!
